OL,3,GNEWSAGroup aims to clear river of
OL,4,Apennywort in five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer group hopes an invasive
OL,7,Fplant species could be cleared from a
OL,8,Flarge section of the River Soar in
OL,9,FLeicestershire in the next five years.
OL,11,FProject River Soar is one of many
OL,12,Fgroups that has supported the Canal and
OL,13,FRiver Trust by carrying out clearances
OL,14,Fof floating pennywort since July.
OL,16,FThe trust said floating pennywort,
OL,17,Fwhich arrived in the UK in the 1980s,
OL,18,Fcan grow up to 20cm (8in) a day and was
OL,19,Fable to double its weight in as little
OL,20,Fas three days.
