OL,3,GNEWSAGroup aims to clear river of
OL,4,Apennywort in five years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy Cipriano, organiser of Project
OL,7,FRiver Soar, said the group had created
OL,8,Fthe "dream" goal of clearing 30 miles
OL,9,Fof the river with the help of experts
OL,10,Fwho successfully removed pennywort from
OL,11,Fa section of the River Stour in Essex.
